    P1-P4 unresolved (their named source records/calibration/report.json has never existed in any ref) and P5 false
    (the measurement payload hardcodes both rates to None), each with outcome, resolver, evidence citation,
    timestamps and reason in ledger.json#resolutions, plus the separate block Act 22 s9 requires.
    
